 00001                ASMB,R,L
 00002* HP CONTRIB "RTE SELF-SUSPEND ROUTINE"  ## 22401-80001 
 00003* MODIFIED FOR RTE BY ARW 770623
 00004* MODIFIED FOR RTE-IV BY ARW 790207 
 00005* CHECK FOR IMULT<=0     ARW 790306 
 00006********************************************************************
 00007* 
 00008*   PROGRAM NAME:  SUSP   TYPE 7
 00009* 
 00010*   PROGRAM PURPOSE:  SELF SUSPEND FOR A GIVEN TIME.
 00011*                     IF PROGRAM IS IN TIME LIST, IT WILL BE RESTORED 
 00012*                     TO TIME LIST AFTER SELF-SUSPEND.
 00013* 
 00014*   INPUTS:  RESOLUTION CODE
 00015*              1  TENS OF MILLISECONDS
 00016*              2  SECONDS 
 00017*              3  MINUTES 
 00018*              4  HOURS 
 00019*            MULTIPLE--THE NUMBER OF HOURS, MINUTES,ETC TO BE SUSPENDED 
 00020*                      AS INDICATED BY THE RESOLUTION CODE. 
 00021* 
 00022*   OUTPUT:  NONE 
 00023* 
 00024*   FORTRAN CALL: 
 00025*      CALL SUSP (IRSL,IMULT) 
 00026* 
 00027*                 WHERE IRSL IS THE RESOLUTION CODE AND IMULT IS THE
 00028*                       MULTIPLE OF THE RESOLUTION CODE.
 00029*                       E.G.  IF IMULT=20  & IRSL=1  THEN SUSPENSION
 00030*                             TIME IS 200MSEC.
 00031*                       IMMEDIATE RETURN IF IMULT<=0
 00032* 
 00033*   ASSEMBLER CALL: 
 00034* 
 00035*      JSB SUSP 
 00036*      DEF *+3
 00037*      DEF IRSL 
 00038*      DEF IMULT
 00039*      <RETURN POINT> 
 00040* 
 00041*      WHERE IRSL AND IMULT CONTAIN THE RESOLUTION CODE AND 
 00042*      MULTIPLE AS DESCRIBED ABOVE. 
 00043                      NAM SUSP,7 Self-suspend routine   ARW 790306
 00044                      EXT EXEC,.ENTR,TMVAL,$OPSY
 00045                      ENT SUSP
 00046  00000 000000  RESLC NOP 
 00047  00001 000000  OFSTO NOP 
 00048  00002 000000  SUSP  NOP           ENTRY POINT 
 00049  00003 014002X       JSB .ENTR     TRANSFER IN PARAMS. 
 00050  00004 000000R       DEF RESLC 
 00051  00005 160001R       LDA OFSTO,I 
 00052  00006 002003        SZA,RSS       RETURN IF IMULT<=0
 00053  00007 124002R       JMP SUSP,I
 00054  00010 002020        SSA 
 00055  00011 124002R       JMP SUSP,I
